     "lat": 53.869167,
     "lng": 10.689444,
     "hours": "",
     "price": "",
     "wikidata": "Q317388",
     "content": "This early 14th-century former Franciscan monastery church is the only surviving conventual church in Lübeck's Old Town. Today operating as a museum, it features an elevated choir built over a double-nave crypt and exterior sculptures by Er",
